# Pass "avec-mlie": Mlie's Vanilla-like Wheat (Continued) beside this mod.
#
# The one optional mod the port names. It grows wheat too, so beside it this wheat leaves the sow menu and the
# fifteen recipes accept its RawWheat as well as their own grain. 08 and 11 play here, because their tag finds
# the mod; 07 is left out with !@wheat-alone, since it asserts the opposite of this pass.
#
# Mlie's mod requires SYR Processor Framework (Workshop 2633514537, syrchalis.processor.framework), so the
# framework comes first: mods of a map are staged and activated in the order of the file. Whether the WSL
# install already holds these two Workshop items has not been checked; a missing one is a download, and a
# download goes through Use-Wsl.ps1 like any other work on the machine (PickleTools/Headless/README.md).
#
# The first line is PickleTools/LoadAudit, the same as in the bare pass.
nelim.pickletools.loadaudit path:PickleTools/LoadAudit/Mod
syrchalis.processor.framework 2633514537
Mlie.VanillalikeWheat 2717707382
